Project Title

Data Cleaning & Reporting Automation Using Python, Excel, and Power BI

Objective

Develop an automated workflow to clean, validate, transform, and report data efficiently. The project aims to reduce manual effort, improve data quality, and generate automated reports with actionable insights.

Problem Statement

Organizations often work with raw datasets containing:

Missing values
Duplicate records
Inconsistent formats
Incorrect data entries
Unstructured information

Manual cleaning and reporting can be time-consuming and error-prone. Automation streamlines these processes, ensuring accuracy and efficiency.

